    {
        "text": "15:22 P.M."
    },
    {
        "text": "Ruins of Chernobog 'District 14'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sector Surface"
    },
    {
        "text": "3 hours into the excavation operation"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_219_meteo_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, stop!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your fingers are bleeding! Stop digging with your hands!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... I can feel something down there... Right down here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't feel it if I'm using a tool... I have to use my fingers to pick up on that tiny whisper of a feeling...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's close!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Meteorite...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(But...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Leave her be.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "If we let them get there first...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's okay, you can do it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti #1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Use Arts! I- I can't. I really can't!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member D"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We can do this even without our Sister, right? Hurry up and make the temperatures nice and different. The bigger the difference, the better!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti #1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll try... But don't blame me if it doesn't work!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member D"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Who else can we blame besides you...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't tease him. He has to concentrate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
