    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$mist_intro",
        "key": "$mist_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "You win.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Said I won't lose.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "You didn't give me a winning choice.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sister!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti #1"
    },
    {
        "text": ".....This one......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti #1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the one they call the Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti #1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "So am I being shot or hanged?;......!;Hi.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The leader of Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's me. You can call me Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Her rings... are turning red?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "......!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Aren't you going to stop her?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Why would I stop our only chance at winning?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Blaze!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "I respect Amiya's decision.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Amiya, no.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nesti, is Rhodes Island not fighting you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nesti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then here on this battlefield, we are not enemies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "FrostNova...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "There is no reason to fight if we are not enemies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go back, Doctor, to your people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Our Sister is so magnanimous.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti #1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Like she needs your approval.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Quiet down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Little rabbit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh, my name is Amiya...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're going to Lungmen too, aren't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...That's right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Then we will be enemies before long, little rabbit. Just, not yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "FrostNova, you and your team aren't as destructive as the other Reunion units.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't blame my people. You don't know what they've been through.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But you don't want them to go on like this!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Oh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "It seems you can read my mind?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't. But I do sense your unease and your consternation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "All of this will be swept away after the fall of Lungmen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island, we can honestly understand you and your squad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "You may think I'm wrong, and that we don't understand you at all...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But FrostNova, ma'am, I know exactly what you've been through.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......Childish.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "FrostNova, those clothes aren't yours, are they?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're not. This was once the cloak of the 'Patriot.' I wove it into a coat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......Oh......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How can you tell?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Never mind...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone has some things they can't say, I suppose.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "FrostNova, Rhodes Island does not seek out conflict. We want to avoid unnecessary bloodshed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And which bloodshed was necessary?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "At the very least, we don't want to fight your squad!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "They are all good, decent people. We absolutely cannot hurt them, or let them hurt innocent people!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Then you must pray we do not meet again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "FrostNova!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I think I don't much want to hurt you either. But if I have to, I will kill you all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "You can come to Rhodes Island. We don't have to fight.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1#8"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then you can try to beat me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Defeat me in battle, and I will consider it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "But of course, once we meet on the battlefield, we are enemies. And as enemies, we will fight to the death.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh yes. This one, for the fox.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A special remedy for frostbite. One-of-a-kind recipe. It relieves the burning and pain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've studied these things for a long time. And you fought very well back there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Warriors willing to sacrifice themselves are the strongest, in my eyes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_1505_frstar_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "FrostNova...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#8"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, wait. I have something to say too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeti #1!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh... huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti #1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's happening?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#8",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's get a drink next time! Your vodka smells great!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't say that out loud!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti #1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1#8"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Goodbye, Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope we never meet again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
